{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Niluas, an android who suddenly activated 276 years after the extinction of humanity, had somehow lost her memory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Together with Naive, her integrated support AI, she sets out to explore her lost memories,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">the mystery of her activation, and the mystery of humanity's extinction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">While battling mysterious figures who suddenly appear and attacking androids, what truth will she uncover?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>[What kind of game?]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is an exploration-based adventure RPG where you explore a devastated world after the extinction of humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use commands to unravel mysteries, defeat enemies, and advance the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The story has five chapters, from chapter 1 to 5.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It features multiple endings, with three variations: Ending A, Ending B, and Ending C.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>[System]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The player's perspective is that of Naive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game is a combination of a traditional command-based RPG and a mystery-solving adventure game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It avoids complex systems, offering a simple gameplay experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>[Voice Actors]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The characters are voiced by the luxurious voice actors, Rena Shiratori and Saki Asagi.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It features partial voice acting, rather than full voice acting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>[Characters]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387320/extras/promo_char1_en.jpg?t=1744451760\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387320/extras/promo_char2_en.jpg?t=1744451760\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387320/extras/promo_char3_en.jpg?t=1744451760\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387320/extras/promo_char4_en.jpg?t=1744451760\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>[Planning and Development]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Team Moko App.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>[Music]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u9b54\u738b\u9b42(maou-damashii)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">----------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong># Confidential Document A10277</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>[Command]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Under the guidance of a support AI, players utilize commands to solve mysteries and unravel tricks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>[Combat]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When moving between locations, players may encounter enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If the player's level is lower than the enemy's, they will be subjected to a preemptive attack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players must engage in combat using normal attacks and skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>[Skills]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Usable skills in combat include the Gravity Cannon and Repair.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">These are powerful, but require &quot;Skill Disks&quot; to activate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Skill Disks&quot; are not easily obtained.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>[Level]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players can level up by achieving victories in combat against enemies, based on the number of enemies defeated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The benefit of leveling up is an increase in HP.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When the player's level is higher than the enemy's, they can launch a preemptive attack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>[Equipment]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Androids do not require traditional equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If a modification chip is found, it is automatically installed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Modification chips are rare and difficult to obtain, but they might be lying around somewhere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>[Androids]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Androids are sentient mechanical lifeforms with self-awareness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">They are bipedal and designed to resemble humans.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3387320?t=1744451760","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387320/003f1de80d33af4aeda1e4ebf897b3edf2632f08/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744451760","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387320/bc6088b995945775f225aa35faddc946630cfcab/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744451760","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387320/bc6088b995945775f225aa35faddc946630cfcab/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744451760","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Niluas, an android who suddenly activated 276 years after the extinction of humanity, had somehow lost her memory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Together with Naive, her integrated support AI, she sets out to explore her lost memories,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">the mystery of her activation, and the mystery of humanity's extinction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">While battling mysterious figures who suddenly appear and attacking androids, what truth will she uncover?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>[What kind of game?]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is an exploration-based adventure RPG where you explore a devastated world after the extinction of humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use commands to unravel mysteries, defeat enemies, and advance the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The story has five chapters, from chapter 1 to 5.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It features multiple endings, with three variations: Ending A, Ending B, and Ending C.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>[System]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The player's perspective is that of Naive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game is a combination of a traditional command-based RPG and a mystery-solving adventure game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It avoids complex systems, offering a simple gameplay experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>[Voice Actors]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The characters are voiced by the luxurious voice actors, Rena Shiratori and Saki Asagi.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It features partial voice acting, rather than full voice acting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>[Characters]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387320/extras/promo_char1_en.jpg?t=1744451760\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.ste