by achieving victories in combat against enemies, based on the number of enemies defeated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The benefit of leveling up is an increase in HP.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When the player's level is higher than the enemy's, they can launch a preemptive attack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>[Equipment]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Androids do not require traditional equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If a modification chip is found, it is automatically installed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Modification chips are rare and difficult to obtain, but they might be lying around somewhere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>[Androids]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Androids are sentient mechanical lifeforms with self-awareness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">They are bipedal and designed to resemble humans.</p>","developers":["Team Moko App."],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387320/f7317a48a1d87af652c1b052e9ccb31f1219e706/header.jpg?t=1744451760","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257110090,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257110090/movie480.mp4?t=1742294414","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257110090/movie_max.mp4?t=1742294414"},"name":"\u30d7\u30ed\u30e2\u30fc\u30b7\u30e7\u30f3","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257110090/c198b6dc54437326b651ccdcad6fab3481407f71/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1742294414","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257110090/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1742294414","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257110090/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1742294414"}}],"name":"Tale of android after the 